StudyAgentFacade --> QuizAttemptService
StudyAgentFacade --> WrongAnswerExplanationService
StudyAgentFacade --> AgentCoordinator
AgentCoordinator --> IntentAnalyzer
AgentCoordinator --> TaskPlanner
AgentCoordinator --> AgentPlanValidator
AgentCoordinator --> AgentToolManager
AgentCoordinator --> MemoryManager
