AgentToolManager --> ProgressService
AgentToolManager --> LearningHistoryService
AgentToolManager --> RecommendationService
AgentToolManager --> CourseSearchService
AgentToolManager --> FlashcardGenerationService
AgentToolManager --> QuizGenerationService
AgentToolManager --> SummarizationService
