GroundedQuestionService --> CourseSearchService
GroundedQuestionService --> LlmClient
SummarizationService --> LlmClient
ConceptExtractionService --> LlmClient
FlashcardGenerationService --> LlmClient
QuizGenerationService --> LlmClient
WrongAnswerExplanationService --> LlmClient
