Quiz "1" *-- "1..*" QuizQuestion
QuizQuestion "1" o-- "0..*" QuizSource
Quiz "1" o-- "0..*" QuizAttempt
StudyPlan "1" *-- "1..*" StudyPlanItem
CourseService --> CourseRepository
CourseMaterialService --> CourseDocumentRepository
