FlashcardGenerationService --> FlashcardRepository
FlashcardReviewService --> FlashcardRepository
FlashcardReviewService --> FlashcardReviewRepository
QuizGenerationService --> QuizRepository
QuizAttemptService --> QuizRepository
QuizAttemptService --> QuizAttemptRepository
StudyPlanService --> StudyPlanRepository
